        sec4Title = "4. Digesting Nigerian Staple Meals & Kwashiorkor Prevention",
        sec4Body = "Tracking pounded yam/garri (starch digested by salivary & pancreatic amylase + maltase → glucose), palm oil (bile emulsifies → lipase → fatty acids + glycerol), and beef/beans (pepsin → trypsin → erepsin → amino acids) explains balanced diet health and why protein deficiency triggers swollen belly Kwashiorkor!",
