        projModel = "Myopia (long eyeball, near focus before retina) uses Diverging Concave lenses; Hypermetropia (focus behind retina) uses Converging Convex lenses; Astigmatism (warped cornea) uses Cylindrical lenses. Ear popping on hills relieves trapped air pressure via the Eustachian tube.",
